WEBVTT

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:22.040
The Statue of Humanity?
What's that?

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:26.120
Don't play innocent with me.
I had a transmitter attached to it.

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:27.090
See?

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:32.360
Whoa, looks like you got me!

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:35.890
Yeah!

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:40.060
So, how did you get
the Statue of Humanity?

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:41.130
What?

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.370
I felt an evil presence
in the night air...

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:45.430
so I performed
a purification ritual.

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:47.570
Evil presence?

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:48.440
Yes.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.900
Then, it came falling from the sky.

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:51.880
Really?

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:58.550
Brother!
What happened?

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:44.690
Hey, where do you think
Ling-Ling went?

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:45.270
YOGEKISHA

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:47.960
She wouldn't have called us all the
way to Hong Kong for no reason.

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:54.410
She said she'd found the Statue
of Humanity and to come at once.

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:59.070
Pai is finally going to be human.

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:01.910
I can't wait
for Ling-Ling to come back!

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:05.490
After all the trouble we caused
before leaving Japan...

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:07.390
it seems almost too easy... Huh!?

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:13.690
Who are you?

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:15.730
Are you with Yogekisha?

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:19.300
Pai came to get
the Statue of Humanity!

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:20.630
The Statue of Humanity?!

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:23.200
Hey!

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:24.970
Then you're the bastards!

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:32.740
Pai! What are you doing?

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:37.150
Yakumo!

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:40.990
I am Mei Shin,
Steve Long's my brother!

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:42.750
Return him to me now!!

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:43.990
Your brother?

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:45.280
Stop!

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:49.320
Don't bully Yakumo,
or Pai will get mad!!

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:52.200
Stop playing innocent!

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:55.370
I'll trade one of the statue's
skulls for my brother!

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.230
Shit!

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:22.100
The Statue of Humanity!

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:23.800
Pai!

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:25.070
It's OK!

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:27.800
Soon, Pai will know
who they really are.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:28.700
What?

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:32.140
Takuhi, I made him small
and now he's following them!

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:36.400
All right, Pai!
Well done!! Genius!

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:39.640
Ah, yes, praise me!
Praise me more!!

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:51.280
My brother's a psychic who earns a
living performing exorcisms.

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:54.690
The name "Steve Long" is rather
well-known here in Hong Kong.

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:59.660
So then, your psychic brother
had the Statue of Humanity?

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:00.770
Right.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:04.200
And that woman from Yogekisha
has disappeared with him.

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.900
Apparently they've been kidnapped.

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:08.870
So Ling-ling was with him?

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:12.010
Hey, is that girl a psychic, too?

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:14.620
Eh, something like that.

00:05:16.320 --> 00:05:17.150
A hotel.

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:23.420
Royal... Soala, Hong Kong.

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:31.660
Ah, it's those men.

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:35.160
You can really see them?
Do they have my brother there!?

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:36.360
Wait a second.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:40.170
Ah! What's that?

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:41.970
My brother! Is he there!?

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:43.170
What about Ling-ling!?

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.750
There's a man there.

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:46.480
It's awful!

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:49.590
He seems to have been tortured
and on the verge of death.

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:50.950
Brother!

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:51.780
Wait!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.050
Soft.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.320
What the hell are you doing!?

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:01.120
Hey, Pai!

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.400
Why do we have to tag along?

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:04.830
Because I'm worried!

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:07.160
A wise student
stays away from trouble!

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:08.330
She can't go alone.

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:08.870
But...

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:09.770
Shut up!!

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:14.100
What do you mean
"there's no 32nd floor"!?

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:17.470
I'm sorry, Miss, this hotel
is only thirty-stories tall.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:18.680
Take it easy!

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:21.270
Don't lie to me!
I know there's a 32nd!

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:24.350
Takuhi went to the
32nd floor of this building!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:27.120
Come on, we know it's true!
Show us the way!

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:29.250
Sorry, but like I...

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:29.790
You!

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:30.920
Honored guests.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:41.700
This is a private floor reserved
exclusively for special guests.

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:44.300
I must request that you
keep it's existence confidential.

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:46.140
Don't worry.

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:47.900
We don't care
about your fancy floor.

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.610
Hang on brother.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:04.350
You bastards!

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:10.730
You fools!

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:22.440
Mei Shin!

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:24.940
Takuhi!

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:39.750
Pai!

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:47.530
Die!!

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:50.570
Takuhi!!

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:25.060
I'm slipping!!

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:29.950
As "Wu" as I am...
As indestructible as I am...

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:33.710
I've no super strength
and I can't stand heights!

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:37.080
Hang in there Pai, I'm coming!!

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:46.020
I made it.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.560
Well, I am pretty great!

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:12.980
What is that?

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:30.430
That doesn't look like Buddha.
It's got to be a Sanjiyan.

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:32.570
It has to be.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:36.570
I don't feel so good.
What the hell is that statue?

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.440
That's Kaiyanwang.

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:43.550
These people are part of a cult that
perform virgin sacrifices for him.

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:44.820
What!?

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:49.520
The statue, that's Kaiyanwang,
the ancient three-eyed demon...

00:09:49.590 --> 00:09:51.460
whom these monsters worship.

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:54.190
You're... Steve Long!

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:56.120
How do you know that?

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:04.360
Lord Kaiyanwang!

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:08.930
At long last I have recovered
the Statue of Humanity!

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:29.890
A monster!

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:33.590
Our sacrifice has finally awakened.

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:35.190
Sacrifice!?

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:40.360
Bastard, what are you
going to do with me?!

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:43.270
Tonight, I will cut open
that white belly of yours...

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:46.800
Take out your bloody intestines,
and give them in praise...

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:51.340
to Lord Kaiyanwang's
resurrection.

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:55.940
Yes, be frightened!
You are going to die!

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:56.710
Stop!

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:59.190
Scream with fear!

00:11:59.360 --> 00:11:59.950
Stop!

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:02.820
Without sufficient fear
this would be boring.

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:14.590
Stop it!

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:18.610
Mei Shin, are you alright!?

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:19.500
Brother!

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:26.580
You miserable insects!!

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:28.740
This is for Takuhi!

00:12:41.430 --> 00:12:42.420
I did it!!

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:44.500
Incredible!

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:48.730
Brother!

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:56.270
Insignificant pest, you think
you can stand against us?!

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:10.060
You don't know your limitations.

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:13.590
Lucky!

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:19.430
I've got the Statue of Humanity!

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:23.700
You bastard!!

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:26.230
Idiot!

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:27.640
Don't make a move!

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:31.410
Take one-step closer, and I'll smash
this statue into a million pieces!

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:40.250
Very well.

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:46.420
Good thing he didn't ask
how I was going to smash it.

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:50.630
Good!

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:53.930
Now, how about telling me
the secret of this statue.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:54.940
Secret?

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:57.530
The secret to turn
Sanjiyans into humans!

00:13:57.610 --> 00:13:59.370
What are you talking about?

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:00.470
What am I talking about?

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:02.810
Well, ten why are
you after this statue?

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:06.280
Oh, so that how it's gonna be?

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:08.120
Then I'll break it!

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:09.980
Wait... it's because...

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:17.160
A master of great power,
who long ago was the first...

00:14:17.230 --> 00:14:20.920
to unite all the
Creatures of Darkness.

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:23.630
He now seeks
to possess that statue.

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:25.160
Kaiyanwang?

00:14:25.230 --> 00:14:30.000
Correct, the Great Kaiyanwang
is going to grant immortality...

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:33.940
to the one who retrieves
the Statue of Humanity.

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:35.770
I see.

00:14:36.650 --> 00:14:39.140
And, where can I find
this Kaiyanwang?

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:43.480
No one knows where he is
or how to find him.

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:49.390
It is said, that he was imprisoned
some 300 years ago...

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:51.720
by an unknown force.

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:53.690
Imprisoned?

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:56.690
Three hundred years ago,
the same as Pai...

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:59.030
Since that time we,
creatures of darkness...

00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:01.130
have worked toward one goal.

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:04.100
The resurrection of Kaiyanwang!

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:12.950
Yakumo!

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:19.180
You fool!

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:20.980
If you're so eager
to shed blood...

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:22.920
during Kaiyanwang's
resurrection ceremony...

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:25.530
then why not have your fill?

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:37.630
Plebeian!
You shall sacrifice this woman!

00:15:38.010 --> 00:15:38.840
What!?

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:45.340
Tear open her stomach with your
own hands and remove her entrails.

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:55.650
I can't control my hand!

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:00.520
Stop it!

00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:04.030
My body's moving against my will.

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:15.710
You're helpless!

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:18.980
Shit!!

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:22.780
With all your strength,
in one stroke.

00:16:23.050 --> 00:16:23.950
What?!

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:50.230
Yakumo!

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:55.050
I fail to see what you'd hoped
to accomplish by that, insect.

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:56.420
Shut up!

00:16:56.690 --> 00:16:59.810
Count on this,
I'm going to beat you to death!

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:04.760
Sounds like fun, watching you
die by your own hand!

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:07.950
If I can be killed,
then why don't you try!!

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:13.340
Pai!

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:23.070
It won't stop!

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:26.810
Pai!

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:28.040
Yakumo!

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:31.070
You idiot!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:32.310
Yakumo!

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:34.490
Pai.

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:35.480
Stupid!

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:36.720
Stupid, stupid, stupid!

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:41.460
Leaving me alone like that!
Yakumo, I hate you for it!

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.020
But, Pai...

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.030
I'm sorry.

00:17:58.510 --> 00:17:59.980
Are you OK, Yakumo?

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:02.750
Long time no see!

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:04.050
Ling-Ling!

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:24.730
This is it!

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:38.990
Hooray! Hooray!
The Statue of Humanity!

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:41.990
Hasn't changed a bit.

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:42.920
Alright!

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:45.360
Now that we have the statue,
let's get out of here!

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:47.900
Ling-Ling, aren't you
over doing it a bit?

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:49.900
Don't worry about it.

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:04.970
Mei Shin!
We found your brother safe.

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:06.870
Um... thank you.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:10.050
Yakumo, how's your right hand?

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.380
It'll grow back soon.

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:14.720
I apologize for...

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:18.020
your boyfriend's injury.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:19.090
Boy...

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:20.030
...friend?

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:23.420
Well, we're not going out
just yet, but...

00:19:23.530 --> 00:19:26.090
Oh! Yakumo's not my boyfriend.

00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:27.360
He's my gang.

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:28.700
Huh?

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:30.230
Your gang!?

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:31.800
You know, a friend.

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:34.400
What, then he's definitely
not your boyfriend?!

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:35.670
Not at all!

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:43.110
I see!

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:44.850
This is no time for chat!

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:47.010
If we don't hurry
we'll be caught in the fire!

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:50.020
Yeah, because you had to set
the whole damn place on fire!

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:51.590
Come on!

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:53.990
Hey!

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:56.760
It's a burn... burn... burning!!

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:58.820
You're out of control!

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:29.830
Ling-Ling, weren't you kidnapped?

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:33.490
When Long's house was attacked,
I managed to escape.

00:20:33.740 --> 00:20:36.930
Then, I followed them back here
and disguised myself as a cultist...

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:38.770
along with Mrs. Wong's men!

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:40.140
Mrs. Wong's men?

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:41.470
Everyone's on board?

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:42.910
Then let's go!

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:44.800
Pai's missing!

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:47.740
What's going on?
She must still be in there!

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:48.850
Pai!

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:50.510
I'm coming, too!

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:52.020
Mei Shin!

00:20:52.090 --> 00:20:55.110
Let go of me brother!
She's the one who saved us!

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:57.880
Thank you, Mei Shin
but you go ahead.

00:20:58.230 --> 00:20:59.490
I can find her.

00:20:59.560 --> 00:21:00.550
Yakumo!

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:01.530
It's OK!

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:13.010
I'm immortal!
I cannot be killed!

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:15.330
So you all, go on ahead!

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:17.640
Yakumo!!!

00:22:27.980 --> 00:22:32.080
Do not remember, Pai.
For it was long ago.

00:22:33.990 --> 00:22:37.430
It took so much effort
to forget these horrors.

00:22:39.360 --> 00:22:40.920
Don't remember.

00:22:43.970 --> 00:22:47.530
For Kaiyanwang is no more.

00:23:24.470 --> 00:23:26.300
Pai!
Where are you?!

00:23:26.940 --> 00:23:28.430
Where are you Pai?!

00:23:33.050 --> 00:23:34.520
You're still alive!?

00:23:37.950 --> 00:23:39.980
As if I'd let you escape!

00:23:40.820 --> 00:23:42.120
Shit!!

00:23:44.290 --> 00:23:45.450
A Wu!?

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:47.690
You can't be!
It can't be true!

00:23:47.960 --> 00:23:51.060
There aren't any other Sanjiyan
but the Great Kaiyanwang!

00:23:51.300 --> 00:23:54.130
This cannot be!
This cannot be!!

00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:01.340
It's not true!

00:24:06.780 --> 00:24:10.220
It's a lie! A lie!!

00:24:11.050 --> 00:24:13.020
You cannot be a Wu!!

00:24:14.790 --> 00:24:16.780
Die! Die!!

00:24:16.960 --> 00:24:19.290
Die and reveal the truth!

00:24:44.890 --> 00:24:47.080
I've had enough
of your interference!!

00:24:50.560 --> 00:24:51.960
Bastard!

00:24:54.060 --> 00:24:55.150
Die!!

00:24:58.100 --> 00:24:58.860
What!?

00:24:58.930 --> 00:24:59.830
Your death...

00:25:00.500 --> 00:25:02.560
is at hand!!!!!

00:25:25.230 --> 00:25:27.990
Yakumo, help me!

00:25:48.120 --> 00:25:51.550
No!! Don't go!
I won't let you leave them!!

00:25:51.620 --> 00:25:52.480
Shut up!

00:25:57.490 --> 00:25:58.690
Pai!!!

00:25:59.190 --> 00:26:00.890
Pai!!
I'm coming!!

00:26:26.690 --> 00:26:29.020
Pai!!!

00:26:30.990 --> 00:26:32.220
Yakumo!

00:28:07.320 --> 00:28:09.620
Pai, why?

00:28:10.290 --> 00:28:12.280
Why did you leave
without telling me?

00:28:13.800 --> 00:28:16.890
Yakumo, what are you going to do
when you become human again?

00:28:17.530 --> 00:28:18.690
What do you mean?

00:28:19.940 --> 00:28:22.630
Come to think of it,
it's a strange fate...

00:28:23.100 --> 00:28:24.440
you and Pai.

00:28:24.740 --> 00:28:25.640
Yeah.

00:28:26.210 --> 00:28:28.770
Why does Pai want to become human?

00:28:29.140 --> 00:28:31.170
Is being human so great?

00:28:31.650 --> 00:28:36.020
If you stopped being human,
I think you'd understand.

00:28:37.720 --> 00:28:39.280
You mean become a Wu?

00:28:40.120 --> 00:28:43.490
That doesn't sound so bad, becoming
immortal and make a lot of money!

00:28:46.130 --> 00:28:50.560
So you're aware of Benares, Pai?

00:28:52.000 --> 00:28:52.970
Yes.

00:28:54.200 --> 00:28:56.330
It's foolish of you to go alone.

00:28:57.870 --> 00:29:01.500
Yakumo, Ling-Ling and Mei-Shin,
they're my gang of friends...

00:29:01.580 --> 00:29:04.740
and I don't want to
bring them any trouble.

00:29:06.250 --> 00:29:07.220
But...

00:29:08.080 --> 00:29:08.810
What?

00:29:09.550 --> 00:29:11.850
Nothing... nothing at all.

00:29:13.190 --> 00:29:15.250
Let's go defeat Benares!

00:29:16.220 --> 00:29:19.520
We must return alive...

00:29:20.500 --> 00:29:21.760
to Yakumo.

00:29:23.830 --> 00:29:24.760
Yes.

00:29:27.470 --> 00:29:31.060
Make it! Make it!
I gotta make it!

00:29:31.740 --> 00:29:33.300
Pai!!!

00:29:34.640 --> 00:29:37.130
3x3 Eyes, Chapter IV: Straying.

00:29:37.780 --> 00:29:41.150
As long as I'm living,
then Pai must also be alive!
